# Precompiled vignettes (multinma-style): ship only the rendered .html +
# .html.asis for the Stan-fitting vignettes; the .Rmd.orig sources, the knitted
# .Rmd intermediates, the precompile script, helpers, and figures stay in git
# but out of the CRAN tarball. introduction.Rmd / data-preparation.Rmd remain
# normal knitr vignettes and are NOT excluded.
^vignettes/.*\.Rmd\.orig$
^vignettes/precompile\.R$
^vignettes/children$
^vignettes/figure$
^vignettes/.*_cache$
^vignettes/binary-outcomes\.Rmd$
^vignettes/continuous-outcomes\.Rmd$
^vignettes/count-outcomes\.Rmd$
^vignettes/survival-outcomes\.Rmd$
^vignettes/fitting-and-diagnostics\.Rmd$
^vignettes/choosing-a-method\.Rmd$
